  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/fancy-entity-renderer/banner.png\" alt=\"Баннер Fancy Entity Renderer\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/minecraft.svg\" alt=\"Minecraft\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-entity-renderer/files?version=26.1&g=26.1.2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/26-1-x.svg\" alt=\"26.1.x\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Разделитель\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-entity-renderer/files?version=1.21.11\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-11.svg\" alt=\"1.21.11\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Разделитель\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-entity-renderer/files?version=1.21.10\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-10.svg\" alt=\"1.21.10\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Разделитель\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-entity-renderer/files?version=1.21.8\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-8.svg\" alt=\"1.21.8\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Разделитель\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-entity-renderer/files?version=1.21.7\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-7.svg\" alt=\"1.21.7\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Разделитель\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-entity-renderer/files?version=1.21.6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-6.svg\" alt=\"1.21.6\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Разделитель\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-entity-renderer/files?version=1.21.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21-1.svg\" alt=\"1.21.1\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Разделитель\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-entity-renderer/files?version=1.21\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-21.svg\" alt=\"1.21\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Разделитель\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-entity-renderer/files?version=1.20.1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/minecraft/1-20-1.svg\" alt=\"1.20.1\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/loader.svg\" alt=\"Загрузчик\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-entity-renderer/files?gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/neoforge.svg\" alt=\"NeoForge\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Разделитель\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-entity-renderer/files?gameVersionTypeId=1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/forge.svg\" alt=\"Forge\"></a><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/separator.svg\" alt=\"Разделитель\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancy-entity-renderer/files?gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/loader/fabric.svg\" alt=\"Fabric\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/side/client.svg\" alt=\"Клиент\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/issues.svg\" alt=\"Проблемы\"><a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/fancy-entity-renderer/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/github/github.svg\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h2>📝 <strong>Описание</strong></h2>\n<p>Fancy Entity Renderer — это мод-API, который позволяет легко отрисовывать сущности на любом экране, в меню, интерфейсе (GUI) или HUD!</p>\n<p><strong>Официально используется в <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fancymenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">FancyMenu</a></strong>:</p>\n<p><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/JhglQuxb6OE?si=sQFgio12yWp651vk\" width=\"100%\" height=\"512px\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<h2>🔗 <strong>Зависимости</strong></h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Мод</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">Загрузчик</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:center\">Требование</th>\n<th style=\"text-align:left\">Назначение</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/prometheus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Prometheus</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Все</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Необязательно <code>1.21+</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Настройка цвета оверлея огня</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/soul-fire-d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Soul Fire'd</a></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Все</td>\n<td style=\"text-align:center\">Необязательно <code>1.20.1</code></td>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\">Настройка цвета оверлея огня</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2>📜 <strong>Лицензия и права использования</strong></h2>\n<p>Вы можете свободно использовать этот мод для других модов, модпаков или видео, просто обязательно укажите авторов и, по возможности, оставьте ссылку <a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/fancy-entity-renderer#readme\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">здесь</a>.<br>\nЭтот проект распространяется под <a href=\"https://github.com/crystal-nest/fancy-entity-renderer/blob/master/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">лицензией Crystal Nest Community License v1</a>.</p>\n<h2>❤️ <strong>Поддержать нас</strong></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fcrystalnest.it%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Сайт Crystal Nest\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/crystal-nest/pic512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://discord.gg/BP6EdBfAmt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/discord/discord512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/crystalspider\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Patreon\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/crystal-nest/mod-fancy-assets/main/patreon/patreon512.png\" width=\"14.286%\"></a><a href=\"/l